{"audio": "3john-01.opus", "voice": "Davis", "duration_ms": 97467, "sentences": [{"start_ms": 0, "end_ms": 800, "text": "3 John."}, {"start_ms": 800, "end_ms": 4800, "text": "The elder unto the wellbeloved Gaius, whom I love in the truth."}, {"start_ms": 4800, "end_ms": 11333, "text": "Beloved, I wish above all things that thou mayest prosper and be in health, even as thy soul prospereth."}, {"start_ms": 11333, "end_ms": 18667, "text": "For I rejoiced greatly, when the brethren came and testified of the truth that is in thee, even as thou walkest in the truth."}, {"start_ms": 18667, "end_ms": 22267, "text": "I have no greater joy than to hear that my children walk in truth."}, {"start_ms": 22267, "end_ms": 38800, "text": "Beloved, thou doest faithfully whatsoever thou doest to the brethren, and to strangers; Which have borne witness of thy charity before the church: whom if thou bring forward on their journey after a godly sort, thou shalt do well: Because that for his name's sake they went forth,"}, {"start_ms": 38800, "end_ms": 40800, "text": "taking nothing of the Gentiles."}, {"start_ms": 40800, "end_ms": 46000, "text": "We therefore ought to receive such, that we might be fellowhelpers to the truth."}, {"start_ms": 46000, "end_ms": 53067, "text": "I wrote unto the church: but Diotrephes, who loveth to have the preeminence among them, receiveth us not."}, {"start_ms": 53067, "end_ms": 66533, "text": "Wherefore, if I come, I will remember his deeds which he doeth, prating against us with malicious words: and not content therewith, neither doth he himself receive the brethren, and forbiddeth them that would, and casteth them out of the church."}, {"start_ms": 66533, "end_ms": 70133, "text": "Beloved, follow not that which is evil, but that which is good."}, {"start_ms": 70133, "end_ms": 75067, "text": "He that doeth good is of God: but he that doeth evil hath not seen God."}, {"start_ms": 75067, "end_ms": 84000, "text": "Demetrius hath good report of all men, and of the truth itself: yea, and we also bear record; and ye know that our record is true."}, {"start_ms": 84000, "end_ms": 93333, "text": "I had many things to write, but I will not with ink and pen write unto thee: But I trust I shall shortly see thee, and we shall speak face to face."}, {"start_ms": 93333, "end_ms": 94267, "text": "Peace be to thee."}, {"start_ms": 94267, "end_ms": 95733, "text": "Our friends salute thee."}, {"start_ms": 95733, "end_ms": 97467, "text": "Greet the friends by name."}], "words": [{"t": "3", "s": 0, "e": 390, "si": 0}, {"t": "John.", "s": 390, "e": 636, "si": 0}, {"t": "The", "s": 1242, "e": 1343, "si": 1}, {"t": "elder", "s": 1483, "e": 1785, "si": 1}, {"t": "unto", "s": 1885, "e": 2086, "si": 1}, {"t": "the", "s": 2127, "e": 2187, "si": 1}, {"t": "wellbeloved", "s": 2227, "e": 2810, "si": 1}, {"t": "Gaius,", "s": 2870, "e": 3313, "si": 1}, {"t": "whom", "s": 3493, "e": 3654, "si": 1}, {"t": "I", "s": 3835, "e": 3855, "si": 1}, {"t": "love", "s": 3916, "e": 4096, "si": 1}, {"t": "in", "s": 4117, "e": 4177, "si": 1}, {"t": "the", "s": 4197, "e": 4277, "si": 1}, {"t": "truth.", "s": 4318, "e": 4699, "si": 1}, {"t": "Beloved,", "s": 5341, "e": 5742, "si": 2}, {"t": "I", "s": 5942, "e": 5962, "si": 2}, {"t": "wish", "s": 6022, "e": 6183, "si": 2}, {"t": "above", "s": 6223, "e": 6443, "si": 2}, {"t": "all", "s": 6503, "e": 6644, "si": 2}, {"t": "things", "s": 6704, "e": 7065, "si": 2}, {"t": "that", "s": 7105, "e": 7245, "si": 2}, {"t": "thou", "s": 7285, "e": 7445, "si": 2}, {"t": "mayest", "s": 7505, "e": 7786, "si": 2}, {"t": "prosper", "s": 7826, "e": 8307, "si": 2}, {"t": "and", "s": 8367, "e": 8467, "si": 2}, {"t": "be", "s": 8487, "e": 8567, "si": 2}, {"t": "in", "s": 8648, "e": 8708, "si": 2}, {"t": "health,", "s": 8788, "e": 9129, "si": 2}, {"t": "even", "s": 9710, "e": 9890, "si": 2}, {"t": "as", "s": 9970, "e": 10070, "si": 2}, {"t": "thy", "s": 10131, "e": 10271, "si": 2}, {"t": "soul", "s": 10351, "e": 10551, "si": 2}, {"t": "p